# Canonical hash of block 5145000. The live hash starts with 0x622f and
# ends with 6e09 (32 bytes). It is not stored as a constant in this tree;
# look it up once and pin it with --eth.requiredblocks (see docs/MINING.md):
#   curl -s -X POST https://rpc.marscredit.xyz -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
#     -d '{"jsonrpc":"2.0","method":"eth_getBlockByNumber","params":["0x4e81a8", false],"id":1}'
# or https://blockscan.marscredit.xyz/block/5145000
# Never mine against that public RPC; lookup only.
